# Example: Supervisor programs (placeholders)

```ini
[program:wanderdesa-worker]
command=php /var/www/wanderdesa/backend/artisan queue:work --sleep=1 --tries=1 --max-time=3600
directory=/var/www/wanderdesa/backend
user=www-data
autostart=true
autorestart=true
stopwaitsecs=60
redirect_stderr=true
stdout_logfile=/var/log/wanderdesa-worker.log
```

Scheduler stays on cron (every minute):

```cron
* * * * * www-data cd /var/www/wanderdesa/backend && php artisan schedule:run >> /dev/null 2>&1
```

Do not run `queue:work` without `schedule:run` — unpaid expiry and payment reconcile would stop.
